+      /*
+       * MenuButton: an accessible menu button (WAI-ARIA APG pattern) with
+       * arbitrarily nested submenus. Items are plain objects:
+       *   { label, href }                       link
+       *   { label, action }                     action, reported via onSelect
+       *   { label, items: [...] }               submenu
+       *   { type: 'radio', name, value, label } single choice bound to state[name]
+       *   { type: 'checkbox', name, value?, label }
